            "title": {
              "ru": "Пять субтестов",
              "en": "Five subtests"
            },
            "body": "The A2 exam (ТБУ, базовый уровень) has the same five subtests as A1: lexis and grammar, reading, listening, writing and speaking.\nEach subtest is scored on its own; the SPbU rule asks for at least 66 % in every subtest, and one subtest may sit at 60 %.\nThis fixture lobby is a test floor: it carries one unit and no floor exam, exactly like the real Вестибюль.\n",
